        <h1>Trauma <em>Therapy</em><span class="h1-loc">Houston (Clear Lake), TX &middot; In-person &amp; statewide telehealth</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">For the past that won't stay in the past — the flashbacks, the bracing, the body that reacts like the danger is still here. A direct, practical path to processing what happened so it stops running your present. Serving Houston&#39;s Clear Lake area in person, and statewide via telehealth. Currently accepting new clients.</p>
